     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"line-break:after-white-space\">\r\n<font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\">Hi D-RUGgies!</font>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div>We are meeting at our (new) normal time tomorrow (1/17) from 10am-noon in the Datalab classroom (360 Shields library). This meeting is to help folks who come in with R programming questions, so come join us and we&#39;ll figure out how to help you. This is\r\n a hybrid meeting so you can also join us via Zoom at this link: <a href=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd%3DS0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464681530000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2h9eadoWzXxbHK77QVlGqv\">https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09</a> I got sick this weekend so I\r\n am going to be joining virtually from quarantine.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Please consider posting your questions to our \r\n<div style=\"display:block\">\r\n<div style=\"display:inline-block\" role=\"link\">\r\n<a style=\"border-radius:10px;font-family:-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;display:block;width:228px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"button\" width=\"228\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.discourse.group/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464681530000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1a61suF-CEchAR0Vs99dFg\">\r\n<table style=\"table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse;width:228px;background-color:#e5e6e9;font-family:-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"228\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"center\"><img style=\"width:228px;min-height:228px\" width=\"228\" height=\"228\" alt=\"9a136a95fbb5e134441536db1a42f033ccbc5fa9.png\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/attach/2826cccbe21aa/9a136a95fbb5e134441536db1a42f033ccbc5fa9.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<table bgcolor=\"#E5E6E9\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"228\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;table-layout:fixed;background-color:rgba(229,230,233,1)\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:8px 0px 8px 0px\">\r\n<div style=\"max-width:100%;margin:0px 16px 0px 16px;overflow:hidden\">\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;font-weight:500;font-size:12px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;text-align:left\">\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.discourse.group/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464681530000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1a61suF-CEchAR0Vs99dFg\"><font color=\"#272727\" style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.847059)\">Davis R Users Group - Supportive R for science and research at UC Davis</font></a></div>\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;font-weight:400;font-size:11px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;text-align:left\">\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.discourse.group/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464681530000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1a61suF-CEchAR0Vs99dFg\"><font color=\"#808080\" style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.498039)\">d-rug.discourse.group</font></a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n site in advance of attending D-RUG virtually. This helps us do a better job of answering your questions, and also keep a log of the types of questions we see frequently.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#1d1d1d\" face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\">See you then,</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#1d1d1d\" face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\">Your D-RUG Coo[R]dinators </font></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><b>For those not familiar with D-RUG</b>, the R Users&#39; Group is a weekly working group to get some help with R-specific coding problems. The coordinators are various and sundry coding connoisseurs, ranging from\r\n UCD data scientists to grad students on campus. We meet for 2 hours in an open-forum format, so you can treat D-RUG as a communal, co-working environment: come hang out and chat, work on your own, seek help, make friends. Or, a little bit of everything! Check\r\n out our <a href=\"https://d-rug.github.io/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(26,115,232)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.github.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464681530000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0IORxh37dyuH7kaOwJNt5v\">website</a> for more information.</font></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div>-- </div>\r\n<font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\">Check out our R resources at <a href=\"https://d-rug.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.github.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464681530000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0IORxh37dyuH7kaOwJNt5v\">https://d-rug.github.io/</a><br>\r\nAnd please post questions/comments at <a href=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.discourse.group/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464681530000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1a61suF-CEchAR0Vs99dFg\">https://d-rug.discourse.group/</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</font>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
